/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:128:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:129:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:130:- The first row is a solid empty separator.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:131:- Below it, each column consists of upper fill cells followed by a contiguous suffix of terrain cells.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:132:- The bottom row is all terrain, so every column has a well-defined first terrain row.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:133:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:134:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:135:- Find the column whose first terrain row is latest; it is unique and its upper fill run becomes maroon.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:136:- Find the rightmost column whose first terrain row is earliest; its upper fill run becomes yellow.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:137:- Preserve the empty separator, terrain cells, and all other upper fill cells.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:138:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:139:Key insight:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:140:- The task is a column-height summary of the terrain profile: color the deepest upper run and the highest terrain peak.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:141:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:142:</reference_puzzle>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:143:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:144:<reference_puzzle index="8" source="train" puzzle_id="4df5b0ae" lines="27-41">
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:145:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:146:Pack the colored sprites along the bottom edge from smallest to largest.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:147:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:148:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:149:The grid has a dominant background color and several monochrome 4-connected
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:150:foreground sprites; a full-grid one-cell frame may surround the scene.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:151:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:152:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:153:Remove any full-grid rectangular frame, sort the remaining sprites by pixel
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:154:area from smallest to largest, and paste their bounding-box sprites left to
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:155:right with each sprite bottom-aligned.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:156:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:157:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:158:The original locations do not determine the final slots; each sprite's area
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:159:gives the packing order, while its shape and color are preserved.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:160:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:161:</reference_puzzle>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:162:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:163:<reference_puzzle index="9" source="train" puzzle_id="e048c9ed" lines="11-26">
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:164:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:165:Add a quantity-color label in the top marker column for each horizontal bar.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:166:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:167:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:168:- The grid has a black background and one non-background marker pixel in the top row.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:169:- Below the marker row, every non-empty source row contains one solid monochrome horizontal bar to the left of the marker column.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:170:- Source rows are staggered every other row.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:171:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:172:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:173:- Copy the input grid.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:174:- For each source bar, read its quantity as the bar length.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:175:- Paint the quantity color in the marker column on the same row as the bar:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:176:  2->1, 3->4, 4->9, 5->6.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:177:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:178:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:179:- The grey marker supplies the result column, while each bar supplies a small quantity with a fixed color code.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:180:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:181:</reference_puzzle>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:182:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:183:<reference_puzzle index="10" source="eval" puzzle_id="45a5af55" lines="5-18">
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:184:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:185:Build nested square frames from a stack of horizontal color stripes.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:186:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:187:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:188:- Full-width horizontal stripes of distinct non-bg colors, stacked vertically.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:189:- Each stripe has uniform color and variable height (1-4 rows).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:190:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:191:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:192:- Read stripes bottom to top.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:193:- Bottom stripe becomes the center solid square with side length = stripe height.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:194:- Each subsequent stripe wraps the current shape with a square frame of thickness = stripe height, in that stripe's color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:195:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:196:Key insight: Stripe height doubles as both frame thickness and (for the innermost) center-square side length; output dimensions are fully determined by the stripe heights.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:197:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:198:</reference_puzzle>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:199:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:200:<reference_puzzle index="11" source="train" puzzle_id="f8cc533f" lines="10-25">
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:201:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:202:Complete every colored sprite by applying the union of all aligned partial sprite masks.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:203:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:204:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:205:- The dominant color is the background.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:206:- Each non-background color appears as a separated partial copy of one common sprite mask.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:207:- The copies share a top-left-aligned sprite window; some copies may be missing lower or right edge pixels.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:208:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:209:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:210:- Crop each same-color mask to its bounding box.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:211:- Pad the crops to the maximum observed height and width, aligned at the top-left, and OR them into one complete template.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:212:- Fill that template at every sprite location using the sprite's own color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:213:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:214:Key insight:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:215:- No single input sprite is complete, but their missing cells are complementary, so the aligned union reveals the full mask.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:216:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:217:</reference_puzzle>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:218:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:219:<reference_puzzle index="12" source="eval" puzzle_id="7666fa5d" lines="12-26">
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:220:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:221:Fill the parallelogram-shaped region between parallel anti-diagonal line segments with red.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:222:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:223:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:224:- bg = most common color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:225:- One non-bg color forms short diagonal segments, each lying on a single anti-diagonal (r+c = const).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:226:- Segments come in parallel pairs bounding a region to be filled.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:227:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:228:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:229:- For each main-diagonal axis (r−c = const), collect anti-diagonal segments whose span covers that axis.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:230:- Sort those segments by their anti-diagonal index (r+c).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:231:- Fill all bg cells lying strictly between consecutive segment pairs along that axis with red (color 2).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:232:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:233:Key insight: The two diagonal directions decouple — segments sit on anti-diagonals, and filling sweeps along main diagonals between them, forming parallelogram regions.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:234:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:235:</reference_puzzle>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:236:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:237:<reference_puzzle index="13" source="train" puzzle_id="ac0c2ac3" lines="7-19">
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:238:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:239:Fill each centered square ring with the color of the marker at that ring distance.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:240:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:241:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:242:The input is an odd square grid with a dominant background color and one
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:243:non-background marker for every Chebyshev distance from the grid center.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:244:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:245:The output replaces the background with concentric square rings centered on
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:246:the middle cell; every cell at distance d from the center takes the color of
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:247:the unique marker whose distance from the center is d.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:248:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:249:The scattered markers are not objects to move; their Chebyshev distances
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:250:form a palette for the centered square rings.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:251:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:252:</reference_puzzle>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:253:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:254:<reference_puzzle index="14" source="eval" puzzle_id="291dc1e1" lines="7-22">
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:255:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:256:Reorder and stack rectangles by proximity to two colored edge lines.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:257:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:258:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:259:- bg = most common color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:260:- Two edge lines (h + v) meet at a corner marked by a unique color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:261:- "Blue" line is color 1 if present, else the longer line; other is "red."
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:262:- Solid rectangles in the interior.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:263:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:264:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:265:- Sort rectangles by (distance to blue edge, distance to red edge).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:266:- If the blue edge is vertical, rotate each rectangle 90° CCW.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:267:- Stack top-to-bottom, centered horizontally.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:268:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:269:Key insight: Edge-line colors encode a coordinate system; proximity to each axis determines stacking order and rotation.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:270:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:271:</reference_puzzle>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:272:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:273:<reference_puzzle index="15" source="eval" puzzle_id="4c7dc4dd" lines="7-21">
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:274:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:275:Learn a transformation rule from a training pair of framed sprites, then apply it to a test sprite.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:276:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:277:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:278:- Grid contains several colored square frames (hollow borders of a single color).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:279:- Each frame's interior holds a small pattern sprite; one frame's interior is blank (all black).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:280:- Two frames form a training pair (their interiors share the same color palette); one remaining frame is the test case.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:281:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:282:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:283:- Identify the training pair by matching interior color sets; the other non-blank frame is the test input.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:284:- Infer the rule mapping source→destination (e.g. reflection, color inversion, gap filling, endpoint extraction, or checkerboard complement).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:285:- Apply that same rule to the test sprite; output the transformed interior.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:286:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:287:Key insight: The puzzle is an analogy — "A is to B as C is to ?" — where you must discover the visual rule from one example pair and generalize it.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:288:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:289:</reference_puzzle>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:290:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:291:<reference_puzzle index="16" source="train" puzzle_id="689c358e" lines="72-88">
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:292:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:293:Mark each arrow-like sprite's pointed frame endpoint with its color and the opposite endpoint black.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:294:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:295:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:296:- The grid has a one-pixel solid rectangular frame around a dominant interior background.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:297:- Inside the frame are monochrome six-pixel sprites shaped as asymmetric T arrows.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:298:- Each sprite has a length-4 bar and a length-3 crossbar one cell closer to the pointed end.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:299:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:300:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:301:- For each sprite, follow its bar axis from the shorter end to the frame.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:302:- Paint that frame endpoint with the sprite color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:303:- Paint the opposite endpoint on the same row or column black.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:304:- Leave the interior background, sprites, and all other frame pixels unchanged.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:305:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:306:Key insight:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:307:- The direction is encoded by the crossbar's off-center position: the nearer end is the pointing end.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:308:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:309:</reference_puzzle>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:310:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:311:<reference_puzzle index="17" source="eval" puzzle_id="58f5dbd5" lines="20-34">
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:312:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:313:Carve color-matched motifs into solid blocks and pack them into a compact grid.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:314:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:315:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:316:- bg = most common color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:317:- Several solid 5×5 monochrome blocks, each a distinct non-bg color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:318:- For each block color, a small same-colored motif sprite elsewhere on the grid.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:319:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:320:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:321:- Match each motif to its same-colored 5×5 block.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:322:- Center the motif within the block and recolor those cells to bg (punching holes).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:323:- Pack all carved blocks into an output grid preserving their original row/column order, separated by 1-cell gaps and a 1-cell outer border.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:324:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:325:Key insight: The motif acts as a stencil — it's not stamped onto the block but carved out of it as background holes.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:326:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:327:</reference_puzzle>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed287049989/9/prompt.md:328:
